{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_112_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_112","textTraditional":"一、十有六年，春，季孫行父會齊侯於陽穀，齊侯弗及盟。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_112_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_112","textTraditional":"弗及者，內辭也。行父失命矣。齊得，內辭也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_112_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_112","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，公四不視朔。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_112_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_112","textTraditional":"天子告朔於諸侯，諸侯受乎禰廟，禮也。四不視朔，公不臣也，以公為厭政以甚矣。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_112_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_112","textTraditional":"三、六月，戊辰，公子遂及齊侯盟於師丘。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_112_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_112","textTraditional":"復行父之盟也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_112_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_112","textTraditional":"四、秋，八月，辛未，夫人姜氏薨。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_112_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_112","textTraditional":"五、毀泉臺。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_112_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_112","textTraditional":"喪不貳事，貳事，緩喪也。以文為多失道矣。自古為之，今毀之，不如勿處而已矣。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_112_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_112","textTraditional":"六、楚人、秦人、巴人滅庸。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_112_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_112","textTraditional":"七、冬，十有一月，宋人弒其君杵臼。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}